                          "text": "₱20"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " per person by day, and even if you ride alone you are advised not to pay more than "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "price",
                          "text": "₱50"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
