    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "key": "best_time",
      "title": "Best time to visit & weather",
      "icon": "wb_sunny",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The sources do not describe how the sardines change by season. In general, the central Visayas is known for a drier season from December to May, so it is safer to schedule water activities then."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "In the rainy season, waves and visibility can change. Before you go, ask a dive shop about recent visibility and where the sardines are. Boats can stop running during typhoon warnings, so leave some slack in your plans."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "label": "Season at a glance",
          "icon": "calendar_month",
          "columns": [
            "Period",
            "Weather",
            "Travel notes"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Dec–Feb",
              "Relatively cool, often clear",
              "Peak season for snorkeling and diving; book lodging early"
            ],
            [
              "Mar–May",
              "Hot and dry",
              "Water temperature and visibility tend to be good; beware midday sun"
            ],
            [
              "Jun–Nov",
              "More rain and wind possible",
              "Quieter and cheaper lodging; check the weather"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
